# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Doric's Quest" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Starting off
1	line	Doric	Hello traveller, what brings you to my humble smithy?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	I wanted to use your anvils.
2	line	Player	I wanted to use your anvils.
2	line	Doric	My anvils get enough work with my own use. I make pickaxes, and it takes a lot of hard work. If you could get me some more materials, then I could let you use them.
2	select	Start Doric's Quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Yes, I will get you the materials.
3	line	Doric	Clay is what I use more than anything, to make casts. Could you get me 6 clay, 4 copper ore, and 2 iron ore, please? I could pay a little, and let you use my anvils. Take this pickaxe with you just in case you need it.
3	cond	If the player does not already have all of the materials:
3	select	Select an Option
4	option	Where can I find those?
5	line	Player	Where can I find those?
5	line	Doric	You'll be able to find all those ores in the rocks just inside the Dwarven Mine. Head east from here and you'll find the entrance in the side of Ice Mountain.
5	cond	If the player does not have 15 Mining:
6	line	Player	But I'm not a good enough miner to get iron ore.
6	line	Doric	Oh well, you could practice mining until you can. Can't beat a bit of mining - it's a useful skill. Failing that, you might be able to find a more experienced adventurer to buy the iron ore off.
6	action	continues
5	action	end
4	option	Certainly, I'll be right back!
5	line	Player	Certainly, I'll be right back!
5	action	end
3	cond	If the player already has all of the materials:
4	line	Player	You know, it's funny you should require those exact things!
4	line	Doric	What do you mean?
4	line	Player	I can usually fit 28 things in my backpack and in a world full of quite literally limitless possibilities, a complete coincidence has occurred!
4	line	Doric	I don't quite understand what you're saying?
4	line	Player	Well, out of pure coincidence, despite definitely not knowing what you were about to request, I just so happened to have carried those exact items!
4	cond	If the player has the exact amounts:
5	line	Player	In fact, in the exact quantities too!
5	action	continues
4	line	Doric	Oh my, that is a coincidence! Pass them here, please. I can spare you some coins for your trouble, and please use my anvils any time you want.
4	box	You hand the clay, copper, and iron to Doric.
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	No, hitting rocks is for the boring people, sorry.
3	line	Doric	That is your choice. Nice to meet you anyway.
3	action	end
1	option	I want to use your whetstone.
2	line	Player	I wanted to use your whetstone.
2	line	Doric	The whetstone is for more advanced smithing, but I could let you use it as well as my anvils if you could get me some more materials.
2	select	Start Doric's Quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	action	above
2	option	No.
3	action	above
1	option	Mind your own business, shortstuff!
2	line	Player	Mind your own business, shortstuff!
2	line	Doric	How nice to meet someone with such pleasant manners. Do come again when you need to shout at someone smaller than you!
2	action	end
1	option	I was just checking out the landscape.
2	line	Player	I was just checking out the landscape.
2	line	Doric	Hope you like it. I do enjoy the solitude of my little home. If you get time, please say hi to my friends in the Dwarven Mine.
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	Dwarven Mine?
3	line	Player	Dwarven Mine?
3	line	Doric	Yep, the entrance is in the side of Ice Mountain just to the east of here. They're a friendly bunch. Stop in at Nurmof's store and buy one of my pickaxes!
3	action	end
2	option	Will do!
3	line	Player	Will do!
3	action	end
1	option	What do you make here?
2	line	Player	What do you make here?
2	line	Doric	I make pickaxes. I am the best maker of pickaxes in the whole of Gielinor.
2	line	Player	Do you have any to sell?
2	line	Doric	Sorry, but I've got a running order with Nurmof.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	Who's Nurmof?
4	line	Player	Who's Nurmof?
4	line	Doric	Nurmof has a store over in the Dwarven Mine. You can find the entrance on the side of Ice Mountain to the east of here.
4	action	end
3	option	Ah, fair enough.
4	line	Player	Ah, fair enough.
4	action	end
